# Servixa v1.1.2 — environment example.
#
# This application has no backend, database or sync service by design: all
# records live in the browser's IndexedDB. Nothing here is required to run or
# deploy it, and no secrets are ever committed.
#
# Copy to .env.local only if you add your own build-time flag; the shipped app
# reads no environment variables at runtime.
